[00:01.40] 作词 : David Gilmour/Polly Samson
[00:01.40][by:LadieuDuSilence]
[00:02.40] 作曲 : David Gilmour
[00:50.17]Beyond the horizon of the place we lived when we were young
[00:50.17]地平线外是我们年轻所居
[00:56.46]In a world of magnets and miracles
[00:56.46]一个充满吸引力与奇迹的世界
[01:02.85]Our thoughts strayed constantly and without boundary
[01:02.85]我们的思想天马行空漫无边际
[01:08.73]The ringing of the division bell had begun
[01:08.73]别离钟声已然敲响
[01:13.67]
[01:15.59]Along the long road and on down the causeway
[01:15.59]沿着长长的路走下堤道
[01:21.94]Do they still meet there by the cut
[01:21.94]他们是否还能在此相遇
[01:25.69]
[01:28.28]There was a ragged band that followed in our footsteps
[01:28.28]一支衣衫褴路的乐队跟在我们身后
[01:34.43]Running before time took our dreams away
[01:34.43]奔跑在夺去我们梦想的时光之前
[01:40.84]Leaving the myriad small creatures trying to tie us to the ground
[01:40.84]留下无数微小生灵，企图将我们困于这片大地
[01:47.19]To a life consumed by slow decay
[01:47.19]生命渐渐腐烂
[01:51.69]
[01:52.35]The grass was greener
[01:52.35]青草更绿
[01:58.28]The light was brighter
[01:58.28]光芒更亮
[02:04.63]With friends surrounded
[02:04.63]好友围绕
[02:11.19]The nights of wonder
[02:11.19]奇妙之夜
[02:13.89]
[02:19.06]Looking beyond the embers of bridges glowing behind us
[02:19.06]回望身后闪耀光芒的桥梁余烬
[02:25.29]To a glimpse of how green it was on the other side
[02:25.29]另一边又是苍翠欲滴
[02:31.75]Steps taken forwards but sleepwalking back again
[02:31.75]前进几步，又梦游般往回走
[02:38.00]Dragged by the force of some inner tide
[02:38.00]内心某种力量拖拽着我
[02:42.79]
[02:44.35]At a higher altitude with flag unfurled
[02:44.35]置身旗帜飘扬的高地
[02:50.75]We reached the dizzy heights of that dreamed of world
[02:50.75]我们抵达梦想世界令人目眩的高度
[02:57.13]
[04:00.61]Encumbered forever by desire and ambition
[04:00.61]永远被欲望与野心束缚
[04:08.07]There's a hunger still unsatisfied
[04:08.07]以及一种无法满足的饥饿
[04:14.64]Our weary eyes still stray to the horizon
[04:14.64]我们疲惫的双眼依然远眺地平线
[04:20.14]Though down this road we've been so many times
[04:20.14]纵然这条路走过无数回
[04:24.30]
[04:25.90]The grass was greener
[04:25.90]青草更绿
[04:31.95]The light was brighter
[04:31.95]光芒更亮
[04:38.31]The taste was sweeter
[04:38.31]滋味更甜
[04:44.64]The nights of wonder
[04:44.64]奇妙之夜
[04:51.03]With friends surrounded
[04:51.03]好友围绕
[04:57.34]The dawn mist glowing
[04:57.34]黎明薄雾闪耀
[05:03.75]The water flowing
[05:03.75]水流潺潺
[05:10.18]The endless river
[05:10.18]河流无尽
[05:12.77]
[05:16.74]Forever and ever
[05:16.74]永远永远
[05:20.04]
